 Q(f'An annulus has outer radius ${a+1}$ and inner radius ${a}$. Its area is $k\\pi$. Find k.',2*a+1,f'Subtract circle areas: $k=({a+1})^2-{a}^2$.|Factor the difference of squares to get ${2*a+1}$.','Subtract areas, not radii.|Factor the difference of two squares.',[1,(a+1)**2+a*a,a+1],check=(a+1)**2-a*a),
