 Q(f'Among ${n}$ distinct books, two specified books must be adjacent. How many row arrangements satisfy this?',2*factorial(n-1),f'Treat the two books as a block, leaving ${n-1}$ units.|Arrange the units and the two books inside the block: $2({n-1})!={2*factorial(n-1)}$.','Use a block for required adjacency.|There are two possible internal orders.',[factorial(n-1),factorial(n)-2,2*factorial(n-2)],check=sum(abs(p.index(0)-p.index(1))==1 for p in permutations(range(n)))),
