 Q(f'How many ordered sums of ones and threes equal ${n}$?',compositions(n,[1,3]),f'Use $f(k)=f(k-1)+f(k-3)$, with $f(0)=1$ and negative-index counts zero.|Iterating yields ${compositions(n,[1,3])}$.','Choose the final summand.|Remove it to obtain a smaller instance.',check=sum(comb(n-2*k,k) for k in range(n//3+1))),
