 Q(f'A fair die has faces 1 through ${2*a}$. What is the probability of an even result?',F(1,2),f'Exactly ${a}$ of the ${2*a}$ equally likely faces are even.|The probability is $1/2$.','Count equally likely elementary outcomes.|Half the faces have the requested parity.',[F(1,a),F(1,2*a),F(a-1,2*a)],check=F(sum(k%2==0 for k in range(1,2*a+1)),2*a)),
